TITLE Calcite kinetics at 200 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp      200
    pH        2
    pe        4
    units     mmol/kgw
    Cu        10
    Ba        5
    -water    1
RATES
Calcite_rate
-start
10 rate = 10 * 1.0
20 moles = rate * TIME
30 if (moles > M) then moles = M
40 SAVE moles
-end
KINETICS 1
    Calcite_rate
        -formula   Calcite 1
        -m0        1
        -m         1
        -steps     10 in 100 steps
USER_PUNCH
    -headings CO2_molality
10 PUNCH MOL("CO2")
END